}\\right\\}\n$$\n\n$V_{DS}$ - $I_D$ characteristics plot.\n\nAssessing MOSFET in saturation:\n\n$$\nI_D = \\frac{1}{2}\\times 200\\times 10^{-6}\\times \\frac{2}{0.18}(1-0.5)^2\n$$\n\n$$\n= 277.77\\ \\mu A\n$$\n\n$$\nV_{DS}=V_{DD}-I_D R_D = 1.8-277.77\\times 10^{-6}\\times 5\\times 10^3\n$$\n\n$$\n=0.41\\ V\n$$\n\n$$\nV_{GS}-V_{TH}=0.5\\ V\n$$\n\nSince $V_{DS}<V_{GS}-V_{TH}$, MOSFET is in TRIODE region.","marks":4,"pageNumbers":[1],"diagrams":[],"sourceImages":[{"src":"/repeat-v2/assets/7e4d6ae22b66dd7d8150/page-1.jpg","pageNumber":1,"bbox":[0,0,1406,1988]}],"confidence":"high","reviewNotes":[]},{"id":"7e4d6ae22b66dd7d8150-q-2","number":"7","markdown":"$$\nI_{o2}=I_{o1}2^{(T_2-T_1)/10}\n$$\n\n$$\n=1\\times 10^{-12}\\cdot 2^{(100-20)/10}\n$$\n\n$$\n=256\\ pA\n$$\n\n$$\nI_D=I_{o2}\\left(e^{V/\\eta V_T}-1\\right)\n$$\n\n$$\n=256\\times 10^{-12}\\left(e^{0.7/2\\times 373/11,600}-1\\right)\n$$\n\n$$\n=0.013\\ mA\n$$\n\n$$\nr_f=\\frac{\\eta V_T}{I_D+I_{o2}}=\\frac{2\\times 373}{11,600(0.013\\times 10^{-3}+256\\times 10^{-12})}\n$$\n\n$$\n=4.946\\ k\\Omega\n$$\n\n**NOTE:** Based on the decimal points taken, diode current and resistance can vary. Please consider the diode current and resistance values with $\\pm (10$ to $15)\\%$ tolerance while evaluating the answer scripts.","marks":3,"pageNumbers":[1],"diagrams":[],"sourceImages":[{"src":"/repeat-v2/assets/7e4d6ae22b66dd7d8150/page-1.jpg","pageNumber":1,"bbox":[0,0,1406,1988]}],"confidence":"low","reviewNotes":["The exponential term denominator formatting is handwritten and slightly unclear; transcribed as visible."]},{"id":"7e4d6ae22b66dd7d8150-q-3","number":"8","markdown":"$$\nP_z=I_{z\\max}V_z\\ \\Rightarrow\\ I_{z\\max}=\\frac{1}{12}=83.33\\ mA\n$$\n\n$$\nV_{in\\min}=I_{T\\min}R+V_z\n$$\n\n$$\n=(I_{z\\min})\\cdot R + V_z = 0.3\\times 10^{-3}\\times 200 + 12\n$$\n\n$$\n=12.06\\ V\n$$\n\n$$\nV_{in\\max}=I_{T\\max}R+V_z\n$$\n\n$$\n=(I_{z\\max})\\cdot R + V_z\n$$\n\n$$\n=0.083\\times 200 + 12\n$$\n\n$$\n=28.6\\ V\n$$","ma